<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Synthetic XBRL fixture. Structure follows the Ind-AS quarterly results
  taxonomy; every figure is invented for testing. No real company data.

  Story: revenue +16%, PAT +48%, driven by EBITDA growth. Exceptional items
  are zero and the effective tax rate is unchanged, so the growth is operating.
-->
